  "has_issues": true,
  "issues": [
    "The memo says the Operational Collection Floor (OCF) facility is \"structured as Term Loan B advances,\" yet also claims OCF has repayment priority over \"Term Loan B\"; an advance cannot be both part of Term Loan B and senior to Term Loan B simultaneously.",
    "It characterizes the real estate collateral release as \"tied to specific repayment milestones,\" but the covenants allow release upon full OCF repayment or by December 31, 2024—meaning collateral can be released without the repayment milestone—contradicting the repayment-linked description."
  ]
